* text=auto eol=lf

*.blade.php diff=html
*.css diff=css
*.html diff=html
*.md diff=markdown
*.php diff=php

# Binary artefacts — `binary` = `-text -diff`, so git never line-normalises
# (eol=lf) nor attempts a text diff on them. Covers the precompressed build
# output (vite-plugin-compression2) and the committed font/image assets.
*.gz binary
*.br binary
*.zst binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.otf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary

/.github/workflows/update-changelog.yml export-ignore
/.github/CONTRIBUTING.md export-ignore
/.github/FUNDING.yml export-ignore
/.github/SECURITY.md export-ignore
/art export-ignore
CHANGELOG.md export-ignore
.styleci.yml export-ignore
README.md export-ignore
LICENSE.md export-ignore
bun.lock export-ignore
bun.lockb export-ignore
